"
`;

exports[`git.branch.cutover (acceptance) given: [case4] a halted cutover the caller undoes when: [t0] the caller aborts then: the caller is back on the source, edit restored, new branch gone 1`] = `
"
🪨 run solid skill repo=ehmpathy/role=mechanic/skill=git.branch.cutover

🐢 all good, paddled back

🐚 git.branch.cutover abort
   ├─ back on: turtle/wave-report @ <sha> (untouched)
   ├─ tracked edits (1) ✓ restored from park
   │  └─ M src/wave.ts
   ├─ untracked: untouched throughout
   ├─ removed: turtle/wave-report-v2 (made by this cutover, never pushed)
   └─ quota: the cutover unit stays spent; abort refunds none
"
`;

